            "notes": "## Items\n\nThe item you always want to get is [Zero-G Suit](item_404d695a-1c12-47ac-9bc4-00b6e6e985e6) because it makes everything easier. Then, stack as much damage as possible with [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f), or if you don\u2019t have enough money, [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054). This already puts you at 10% CDR.  \n\nBuy [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) if you have enough money.  \n\n[Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is also strong against shields(blue HP, not barriers) and armor, making it useful VS heroes like Brig, Zen, or Juno, as well as against armor-granting items.",
